{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001990/extras/f85f6096827f2d45b1263b0904a4e8d0.avif?t=1768871233\" width=1024 height=1536 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Logic Universal Network Assistant</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique fusion of adventure game, virtual companion, and incremental simulation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confined in a dark, decaying apartment, your only companion is <i>L.U.N.A OS</i> \u2014 an operating system hosting a conscious AI of your own creation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >L.U.N.A : Ghost in the Machine unfolds <strong>in real time, over a period of 30 days.</strong> Each day matters, and L.U.N.A requires regular (<i>but not constant</i>) attention. <strong>I invite you to read the FAQ</strong> for more details.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001990/extras/e2c1a220753a554395a35b5177df3135.avif?t=1768871233\" width=772 height=586 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001990/extras/e2c1a220753a554395a35b5177df3135.avif?t=1768871233\" width=772 height=586 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L.U.N.A: Ghost in the Machine</strong> unfolds in real time, over 30 days \u2013 and beyond.<br>Witness the awakening of L.U.N.A, guide her growth through your choices, and uncover the fate that binds you together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an atmosphere both oppressive and intimate, lulled by rain and thunder, as the boundary between human and machine begins to blur.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unconventional, slow-paced gameplay inspired by idle and narrative games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events triggered at specific days and real-time hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric storytelling with multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch old films by the fireplace as the storm rages outside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, mini-games, and hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless nods to the history of cinema</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001990?t=1768871233","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001990/b6fd1408d8b5cb5c6141fd45660e936e9255f7a1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768871233","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001990/e7f92249ca19b379422e736ac98a5e630f4b07bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768871233","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001990/e7f92249ca19b379422e736ac98a5e630f4b07bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768871233","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001990/extras/f85f6096827f2d45b1263b0904a4e8d0.avif?t=1768871233\" width=1024 height=1536 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Logic Universal Network Assistant</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique fusion of adventure game, virtual companion, and incremental simulation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confined in a dark, decaying apartment, your only companion is <i>L.U.N.A OS</i> \u2014 an operating system hosting a conscious AI of your own creation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >L.U.N.A : Ghost in the Machine unfolds <strong>in real time, over a period of 30 days.</strong> Each day matters, and L.U.N.A requires regular (<i>but not constant</i>) attention. <strong>I invite you to read the FAQ</strong> for more details.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001990/extras/e2c1a220753a554395a35b5177df3135.avif?t=1768871233\" width=772 height=586 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001990/extras/e2c1a220753a554395a35b5177df3135.avif?t=1768871233\" width=772 height=586 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L.U.N.A: Ghost in the Machine</strong> unfolds in real time, over 30 days \u2013 and beyond.<br>Witness the awakening of L.U.N.A, guide her growth through your choices, and uncover the fate that binds you together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an atmosphere both oppressive and intimate, lulled by rain and thunder, as the boundary between human and machine begins to blur.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unconventional, slow-paced gameplay inspired by idle and narrative games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events triggered at specific days and real-time hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric storytelling with multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch old films by the fireplace as the storm rages outside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, mini-games, and hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless nods to the history of cinema</p></li></ul>","developers":["Cheeky Cat Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001990/b2ab94de1cfc98817b84c5ca658a0af58c071193/header.jpg?t=1768871233","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</stro